        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>French Desserts</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"BiauKai\", serif;\n        background-color: #e8e4d9;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 20px;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .page-container {\n        background-color: rgba(253, 253, 250, 0.95);\n        max-width: 750px;\n        padding: 40px 50px;\n        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n        border-radius: 8px;\n    }\n    .dessert-item {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n        margin-bottom: 35px;\n    }\n    .dessert-item:last-child {\n        margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n    .left-column {\n        width: 150px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: center;\n        margin-right: 25px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n        background-color: #f0f0f0;\n        border: 1px dashed #aaa;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        text-align: center;\n        color: #666;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n    .title {\n        color: #c85a17;\n        font-size: 20px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        text-align: center;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .right-column {\n        flex-grow: 1;\n        font-size: 17px;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        color: #222;\n        text-align: justify;\n        padding-top: 5px;\n    }\n    \n    .ph-calissons { width: 120px; height: 80px; }\n    .ph-coussin { width: 120px; height: 70px; }\n    .ph-ile { width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50%; }\n    .ph-tarte { width: 110px; height: 90px; }\n    .ph-poire { width: 100px; height: 120px; }\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page-container\">\n\n    <div class=\"dessert-item\">\n        <div class=\"left-column\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-calissons\">[Photo: Calissons]</div>\n            <div class=\"title\">卡里颂糖</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"right-column\">\n            Calissons卡里颂糖是一种传统的法国糖果，由光滑、淡黄色、均匀的蜜饯（尤其是甜瓜和橙子）和杏仁粉组成，上面覆盖着一层薄薄的糖霜。它们的质地类似于杏仁软糖，但具有更浓郁的果味和明显的甜瓜味。通常呈杏仁状，长约五厘米。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"dessert-item\">\n        <div class=\"left-column\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-coussin\">[Photo: Coussin de Lyon]</div>\n            <div class=\"title\">里昂枕巧克力</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"right-column\">\n            Coussin de Lyon是里昂高级手工巧克力，绿色外皮是杏仁泥，中间有深色色的直线，内馅是调了些许橙酒的黑巧克力馅。以用杏仁和巧克力、柑橘清香闻名于世。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"dessert-item\">\n        <div class=\"left-column\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-ile\">[Photo: île flottante]</div>\n            <div class=\"title\">漂浮岛</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"right-column\">\n            île flottante 这个具有神秘又有趣名称的甜品是法国经典甜品之一。白白胖胖的蛋清浮在蛋奶做成的英式卡仕达酱上，就像是一座无人小岛。可爱又美味。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"dessert-item\">\n        <div class=\"left-column\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-tarte\">[Photo: Tarte au citron]</div>\n            <div class=\"title\">柠檬塔</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"right-column\">\n            Tarte au citron，一款历史悠久的美食，从南法城市Menton开始流行。每年的二、三月都会举办柠檬节，城中以柠檬与鲜花制作的花车游行最为盛名。在塔皮挤入柠檬奶油馅，再以蛋白饼或蛋白霜装饰，是现在常见的柠檬塔形式。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"dessert-item\">\n        <div class=\"left-column\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder ph-poire\">[Photo: Poire à la Beaujolaise]</div>\n            <div class=\"title\">红酒炖梨</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"right-column\">\n            Poire à la Beaujolaise，法国博若莱葡萄酒产区的传统甜点，果味红酒搭配糖或蜂蜜、丁香、胡椒、香草荚等香料炖煮梨，梨充分入味，甜软飘香。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
